  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5ef4e93c-3f84-5e1d-8506-d981a5ad63a7" activityNameId="5c2f6a30-500a-5539-bd27-82b6aa491aa6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Round wood, primary forest, clear-cutting, at forest road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Round wood, primary forest, clear-cutting, at forest road
Multi-output process providing the products "round wood, primary forest, clear-cutting, at forest road" and "provision, stubbed land". Emissions from wood burning and land transformation are allocated to the provision of stubbed land. The round wood dataset must not be used as a basis for comparison with tropical wood from sustainable forest management. The environmental impacts of tropical wood from clear-cutting must be evaluated in combination with the environmental impacts related to the provision of stubbed land.;
UUID: b23a6bb4-8174-3d92-aa5d-629135f9a778
Resources (wood, carbon, land), land transformation, emissions from wood burning, rough estimation for machinery use. Construction of roads and transports of wood not included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Clear-cutting of primary forests with burning of biomass.
Time period: Publication of data
Production volume: 150000 ha/a for palm fruits
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Rough estimation of machinery use with European forestry data. Emissions profile for tropical forest per kg of dry biomass.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b23a6bb4-8174-3d92-aa5d-629135f9a778.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
